SELECT P."ID" AS "Patient ID", L."T-CHO" AS "T-CHO index" FROM Patient P JOIN Laboratory L ON P."ID" = L."ID" WHERE L."T-CHO" = (SELECT MAX("T-CHO") FROM Laboratory) ORDER BY P."Birthday" ASC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT CAST(SUM(strftime('%Y', 'now') - strftime('%Y', Birthday)) AS REAL) / COUNT(ID) AS avg_age FROM Patient WHERE SEX = 'M' AND ID IN (SELECT ID FROM Laboratory WHERE "T-CHO" >= 250)	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT "Patient"."ID", "Patient"."Diagnosis" FROM "Patient" JOIN "Laboratory" ON "Patient"."ID" = "Laboratory"."ID" WHERE "Laboratory"."TG" > 300	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) FROM Laboratory JOIN Patient ON Laboratory.ID = Patient.ID WHERE Laboratory.TG >= 200 AND (strftime('%Y', 'now') - strftime('%Y', Patient.Birthday)) > 50	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.Admission = '-' AND Laboratory.CPK < 250	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) AS male_patient_count FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.SEX = 'M' AND STRFTIME('%Y', Patient.Birthday) BETWEEN '1936' AND '1956' AND Laboratory.CPK >= 250	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID, Patient.SEX, CAST(strftime('%Y', 'now') AS INTEGER) - CAST(strftime('%Y', Patient.Birthday) AS INTEGER) AS age FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.GLU >= 180 AND Laboratory."T-CHO" < 250	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT "Patient"."ID", "Laboratory"."GLU" FROM "Patient" JOIN "Laboratory" ON "Patient"."ID" = "Laboratory"."ID" WHERE STRFTIME('%Y', "Patient"."Description") = '1991' AND "Laboratory"."GLU" < 180	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID, Patient.SEX, Patient.Birthday FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.WBC < 3.5 OR Laboratory.WBC > 9.0 ORDER BY Patient.SEX ASC, Patient.Birthday DESC	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT TRIM("Patient"."Diagnosis") AS "Diagnosis", "Patient"."ID" AS "ID", (strftime('%Y', 'now') - strftime('%Y', substr("Patient"."Birthday", 1, 10))) AS "Age" FROM "Patient" JOIN "Laboratory" ON "Patient"."ID" = "Laboratory"."ID" WHERE "Laboratory"."RBC" < 3.5	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID AS patient_id, Patient.Admission AS admission FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.SEX = 'F' AND (strftime('%Y', 'now') - strftime('%Y', Patient.Birthday)) >= 50 AND (Laboratory.RBC <= 3.5 OR Laboratory.RBC >= 6.0)	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT p."ID", p."SEX" FROM Patient p JOIN Laboratory l ON p."ID" = l."ID" WHERE p."Admission" = '-' AND l."HGB" < 10	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT p."ID", p."SEX" FROM "Patient" p JOIN "Laboratory" l ON p."ID" = l."ID" WHERE p."Diagnosis" = 'SLE' AND l."HGB" > 10 AND l."HGB" < 17 ORDER BY p."Birthday" ASC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT P.ID, CAST(STRFTIME('%Y', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP) AS INTEGER) - CAST(STRFTIME('%Y', P."Birthday") AS INTEGER) AS age FROM Patient AS P JOIN Laboratory AS L ON P.ID = L.ID WHERE L.HCT >= 52 GROUP BY P.ID, P."Birthday" HAVING COUNT(L.ID) > 2	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT AVG(HCT) AS avg_hct FROM Laboratory WHERE Date LIKE '1991%' AND HCT < 29	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT SUM(PLT < 100) - SUM(PLT > 400) AS comparison FROM Laboratory WHERE PLT <= 100 OR PLT >= 400	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID AS patient_id FROM Laboratory JOIN Patient ON Laboratory.ID = Patient.ID WHERE STRFTIME('%Y', Laboratory.Date) = '1984' AND Laboratory.PLT BETWEEN 100 AND 400 AND (CAST(STRFTIME('%Y', 'now') AS INTEGER) - CAST(STRFTIME('%Y', Patient.Birthday) AS INTEGER)) < 50	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN l."PT" >= 14 AND p."SEX" = 'F' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS REAL) * 100.0 / SUM(CASE WHEN l."PT" >= 14 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS percentage FROM Patient p JOIN Laboratory l ON p."ID" = l."ID" WHERE (STRFTIME('%Y', 'now') - STRFTIME('%Y', p."Birthday")) > 55	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient."First Date" >= '1993-01-01' AND Laboratory.PT < 14	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(*) AS examination_count FROM Examination WHERE "Examination Date" > '1997-01-01' AND EXISTS ( SELECT 1 FROM Laboratory WHERE Laboratory.ID = Examination.ID AND Laboratory.APTT < 45 )	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Laboratory.ID) AS patient_count FROM Laboratory JOIN Examination ON Laboratory.ID = Examination.ID WHERE Laboratory.APTT > 45 AND Examination.Thrombosis = 0	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) AS patient_count FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.Sex = 'M' AND Laboratory.WBC > 3.5 AND Laboratory.WBC < 9.0 AND (Laboratory.FG <= 150 OR Laboratory.FG >= 450)	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) AS patient_count FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.Birthday > '1980-01-01' AND (Laboratory.FG < 150 OR Laboratory.FG > 450)	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT TRIM(p.Diagnosis) AS Diagnosis FROM Laboratory l JOIN Patient p ON l.ID = p.ID WHERE CAST(l."U-PRO" AS INTEGER) >= 30	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.ID FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Patient.Diagnosis = 'SLE' AND CAST(Laboratory."U-PRO" AS INTEGER) > 0 AND CAST(Laboratory."U-PRO" AS INTEGER) < 30	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT "ID") AS patient_count FROM "Laboratory" WHERE "IGG" >= 2000	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT e.ID) AS num_patients FROM Examination e INNER JOIN Laboratory l ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE l.IGG > 900 AND l.IGG < 2000 AND e.Symptoms IS NOT NULL	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT Patient.Diagnosis FROM Laboratory JOIN Patient ON Laboratory.ID = Patient.ID WHERE Laboratory.IGA BETWEEN 80 AND 500 ORDER BY Laboratory.IGA DESC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) AS patient_count FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.IGA > 80 AND Laboratory.IGA < 500 AND STRFTIME('%Y', Patient."First Date") >= '1990'	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT TRIM(Patient.Diagnosis) AS Diagnosis FROM Laboratory JOIN Patient ON Laboratory.ID = Patient.ID WHERE Laboratory.IGM <= 40 OR Laboratory.IGM >= 400 GROUP BY TRIM(Patient.Diagnosis) ORDER BY COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) DESC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.CRP = '+' AND Patient.Description IS NULL	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) FROM Patient INNER JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.CRE >= 1.5 AND CAST(strftime('%Y', 'now') AS INTEGER) - CAST(strftime('%Y', Patient.Birthday) AS INTEGER) < 70	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Examination.ID) AS patient_count FROM Examination JOIN Laboratory ON Examination.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE Laboratory.RA IN ('-', '+-') AND Examination.KCT = '+'	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT Patient.Diagnosis FROM Patient JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE STRFTIME('%Y', Patient.Birthday) >= '1985' AND Laboratory.RA IN ('-', '+-')	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT "Patient"."ID" FROM "Laboratory" JOIN "Patient" ON "Laboratory"."ID" = "Patient"."ID" WHERE "Laboratory"."RF" IS NOT NULL AND CAST(REPLACE(REPLACE("Laboratory"."RF", '<', ''), '>', '') AS REAL) < 20 AND "Laboratory"."Date" > DATE("Patient"."Birthday", '+60 years')	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT "Laboratory"."ID") FROM "Laboratory" JOIN "Examination" ON "Laboratory"."ID" = "Examination"."ID" WHERE "Examination"."Thrombosis" = 0 AND CAST(REPLACE("Laboratory"."RF", '<', '') AS REAL) < 20	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT e.ID) AS patient_count FROM Examination e JOIN Laboratory l ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE e."ANA Pattern" = 'P' AND l.C3 > 35	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT e.ID FROM Examination e WHERE EXISTS ( SELECT 1 FROM Laboratory l WHERE l.ID = e.ID AND (l.HCT <= 29 OR l.HCT >= 52) ) ORDER BY e."aCL IgA" DESC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT e.ID) AS num_patients FROM Examination e JOIN Laboratory l ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE e.Thrombosis > 0 AND l.C4 > 10	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Patient.ID) FROM Laboratory JOIN Patient ON Laboratory.ID = Patient.ID WHERE Laboratory.RNP IN ('negative', '0') AND Patient.Admission = '+'	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT MAX(P."Birthday") AS Birthday FROM Patient P JOIN Laboratory L ON L."ID" = P."ID" WHERE L."RNP" NOT IN ('-', '+-')	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT l.ID) AS count FROM Laboratory l JOIN Examination e ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE l.SM IN ('negative','0') AND e.Thrombosis = 0	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT Patient.ID FROM Patient WHERE Patient.ID IN (SELECT Laboratory.ID FROM Laboratory WHERE Laboratory.SM NOT IN ('negative','0')) ORDER BY Patient.Birthday DESC LIMIT 3	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT e.ID FROM Examination e JOIN Laboratory l ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE e."Examination Date" > '1997-01-01' AND l.SC170 IN ('negative','0')	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(*) AS female_normal_antiscl70_no_symptoms FROM "Patient" p WHERE p."SEX" = 'F' AND EXISTS ( SELECT 1 FROM "Laboratory" l WHERE l."ID" = p."ID" AND l."SC170" = 'negative' ) AND NOT EXISTS ( SELECT 1 FROM "Examination" e WHERE e."ID" = p."ID" AND e."Symptoms" IS NOT NULL AND e."Symptoms" != '' )	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT "ID") FROM "Laboratory" WHERE "SSA" IN ('0','negative') AND "Date" < '2000-01-01'	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT p.ID FROM Patient p JOIN Laboratory l ON p.ID = l.ID WHERE l.SSA NOT IN ('negative', '0') ORDER BY p."First Date" ASC LIMIT 1	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT e.ID) AS patient_count FROM Examination e JOIN Laboratory l ON e.ID = l.ID WHERE e.Diagnosis = 'SLE' AND l.SSB IN ('negative','0')	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Examination.ID) FROM Laboratory JOIN Examination ON Laboratory.ID = Examination.ID WHERE Laboratory.SSB IN ('negative', '0') AND Examination.Symptoms IS NOT NULL	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT "Patient"."ID") AS male_count FROM "Laboratory" JOIN "Patient" ON "Laboratory"."ID" = "Patient"."ID" WHERE "Laboratory"."CENTROMEA" IN ('negative','0') AND "Laboratory"."SSB" IN ('negative','0') AND "Patient"."SEX" = 'M'	thrombosis_prediction
SELECT DISTINCT TRIM(Patient.Diagnosis) AS Diagnosis FROM Patient INNER JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID WHERE CAST(Laboratory.DNA AS REAL) >= 8	thrombosis_prediction
